// Go maps share their storage when copied or passed to a function. The private
// fields describe type arguments; access goes through Map operations.
// Go target only. Import option to use MapLookup, whose result is Option(V).
// MapSet initializes nil storage; MapInit preserves an existing map. MapGet
// returns a zero value for absent keys. MapKeys returns an unordered snapshot.
Map :: struct($K: Type, $V: Type) {
    key: K
    value: V
}
